@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #E8F4FD
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #2980B9
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3CD
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #F0AD4E
skinparam ArrowColor #2C3E50
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #F9A825
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"

title **Nested Cross-Validation & Evaluation Protocol**\n(Subject-Dependent, Grouped by Trial)

start

:Load **checkpoint.csv** (if exists)
to recover completed folds;

#E8EAF6:=== Per-Subject Loop ===;

while (For each **subject** s = 1..32?) is (next subject)

  #E8EAF6:Load & preprocess EEG for subject **s**
  Extract features -> **X** [800 x F]
  Compute trial group IDs -> **groups** [800]
  Build labels for dimension (val/aro) -> **y** [800];

  note right
    Check **feature cache** first
    (SHA-256 hash of config)
    If cache hit: load .npz
    If cache miss: compute & save
  end note

  #E8F5E9:=== Outer Splits ===;

  while (For each outer repeat **r** = 1..5?) is (next repeat)

    if (Checkpoint has\n(subject=s, split=r)?) then (yes)
      #E0F2F1:Load metrics from checkpoint
      **Skip** this fold;
      note right #E8F5E9
        Enables pause/resume
        without recomputation
      end note
    else (no)

      #E8F5E9:Randomly split 40 trials into
      **32 train trials** (80%)
      **8 test trials** (20%)
      (seeded by random_state + subject_id);

      note right
        **Grouped split**: all windows from
        a trial go to the same set.
        Train: ~640 windows
        Test: ~160 windows
        **No leakage across trials**
      end note

      #E8F5E9:Partition X, y by trial groups
      X_train, y_train (32 trials)
      X_test, y_test (8 trials);

      #FFF3E0:=== Inner Grid Search ===;

      #FFF3E0:Define hyperparameter grid
      for selected model;
      note right
        Example (XGBoost):
        n_estimators: [200, 400]
        max_depth: [3, 5]
        learning_rate: [0.05, 0.1]
        subsample: [0.8, 1.0]
        colsample_bytree: [0.8, 1.0]
        = 32 combinations
      end note

      while (For each **param set** in grid?) is (next params)

        #FFF3E0:Inner **GroupKFold** (4 folds)
        on X_train, grouped by trial;

        while (For each inner fold **k** = 1..4?) is (next inner fold)
          #FFF3E0:Train model on inner-train
          Evaluate on inner-val
          Record scoring metric (F1 macro);
        endwhile (done)

        #FFF3E0:Compute mean inner score
        for this param set;

      endwhile (all param sets evaluated)

      #FFF3E0:Select **best_params** =
      param set with highest
      mean inner score;

      #FCE4EC:=== Final Evaluation ===;

      #FCE4EC:Build model with **best_params**
      Train on full X_train (32 trials)
      Predict on X_test (8 trials);

      #FCE4EC:Compute **window-level** metrics
      (accuracy, F1, ROC-AUC, ...);

      #F3E5F5:=== Trial Aggregation ===;

      #F3E5F5:For each of the 8 test **trials**:
      Collect all window predictions
      Apply **majority vote** ->
      one prediction per trial;

      #F3E5F5:Compute **trial-level** metrics
      (trial_accuracy, trial_f1_macro,
      trial_balanced_accuracy);

      #E0F2F1:=== Checkpoint ===;

      #E0F2F1:Append fold result to
      **checkpoint.csv**
      (feature_tag, model, dim,
      subject, split, metrics,
      best_params, train/test trials);

      #E0F2F1:Update **summary_live.txt**
      with running mean accuracy;

    endif

  endwhile (all 5 repeats done)

  #E8EAF6:Compute **per-subject** mean accuracy
  across 5 repeats for subject **s**;

endwhile (all 32 subjects done)

#EFEBE9:=== Final Aggregation ===;

#EFEBE9:Compute **overall** statistics:
mean(per_subject_means) +/- std
for each metric;

note right
  **Reported result** =
  mean of 32 subject means
  e.g. Valence: 66.72% +/- 8.94%
  Total folds: 32 x 5 = **160**
end note

#EFEBE9:Write final outputs:
**experiment_report.json**
**summary.csv**
**summary.txt**;

stop

legend right
  |= Color |= Stage |
  | <#E8EAF6> | Data & subject loop |
  | <#E8F5E9> | Outer CV splits |
  | <#FFF3E0> | Inner grid search |
  | <#FCE4EC> | Model evaluation |
  | <#F3E5F5> | Trial aggregation |
  | <#E0F2F1> | Checkpointing |
  | <#EFEBE9> | Final output |
endlegend

@enduml
